<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria places 5.1 bln lvs 3-mth discount T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria places 5.1 bln lvs 3-mth discount T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry on Wednesday placed a special three-month discount T-bill issue worth 5.11 billion levs and yielding 8.32 percent to maturity, the central bank said.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice the central bank did not say with which financial institution or institutuons the issue was placed.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow. Price in percent of par:</p>
<p>@</p>
<p> Issue number		 BG3036297003</p>
<p> Maturity		     three months</p>
<p> Par value		    5.11 bln levs</p>
<p> Issue date		   May 21</p>
<p> Maturity date		August 20</p>
<p> Selling price		92.32 pct</p>
<p> Yield to maturity	  8.32 pct</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
